<title>FRANCE: Bouygues Telecom/Lyonnaise link logical - Messier.</title>
<headline>Bouygues Telecom/Lyonnaise link logical - Messier.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux chairman Jean-Marie Messier said on Thursday that a rumoured link between Lyonnaise des Eaux communication unit and Bouygues Telecom was &quot;logical&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;Looking at their relative sizes I think it is very logical that these two companies are teaming up,&quot; he said during a news conference on Generale's 1996 results.</p>
<p>Earlier that day, Lyonnaise chairman Jerome Monod said his company had &quot;no particular talks&quot; going on with any company but was seeking partners to become a leading European telecoms and communications player.</p>
</text>
